cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this companion repository and the associated manuscripts."
title: "Exact computational certificates for CMR blue percolation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pei
    given-names: Yan Ru
date-released: 2026-09-27
url: "https://github.com/PeaBrane/cmr-blue-percolation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PeaBrane/cmr-blue-percolation"
abstract: >-
  Exact rational certificates accompanying Towards the spin-glass transition
  in finite dimensions via blue percolation. They cover CMR blue percolation of
  both overlap signs in dimensions 10, 11 and 12 by the overlap-revealed route,
  in dimension 9 by the overlap-revealed route with noisy-cavity local inputs,
  and in dimensions 9, 8 and 7 by the macrostep interaction-matrix route; the
  single-floor oriented comparison in dimensions 16 to 20, 22 and 25; the
  dimension-22 fresh-star certificate; and simultaneous blue percolation with
  finite spin-glass susceptibility in dimension 180. The repository also holds
  the window constants, the explicit two-dimensional and sparse-insulation
  windows and finite sanity checks for the companion manuscript on uniqueness
  in the diluted plus-minus-one Edwards-Anderson model, together with
  independent crosschecks and full reproductions of the stored engine outputs.
